      "settings": {
        "title": "By women, for women",
        "text": "<p>We're a female-led startup based in Germany, committed to addressing the hormone imbalances responsible for menstrual discomfort</p><p>Our approach revolves around a holistic and natural methodology that taps into the body's innate healing capacity, with the goal of restoring harmony throughout every phase of your cycle.</p>",
        "url": "shopify://pages/cycle-assessment",
        "label": "Take the quiz",
        "name_1": "Dr. Ashley Florestal",
        "field_1": "Licensed Naturopath",
        "text_1": "Ashley focusses on women's health, hormones and fertility. She helps patients achieve hormonal balance, prepare for pregnancy, and optimize their health through her clinical practice and ongoing education.",
        "name_2": "Dr. Cassandra Paiano",
        "field_2": "Licensed Naturopath",
        "text_2": "Cassandra uses an evidence-based approach to diagnose and treat disease. She holds a Doctor of Naturopathy degree from CCNM, Toronto, and has an undergraduate degree in Nutritional Sciences from Ryerson University.",
        "name_3": "Melissa Mastroberardino",
        "field_3": "Registered Holistic Nutritionist (RHN)",
        "text_3": "Melissa specialises in hormonal and digestive health. She studied at the Canadian School of Natural Nutrition and helps women uncover imbalances and deficiencies to improve their overall well-being through customised protocols."
      }
    },
