    "0a241f58-774b-4dc9-b402-ebb3e6193972": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "template--17607372964115__0a241f58-774b-4dc9-b402-ebb3e6193972-16739655325d1e4dcf-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do contraceptive methods or fertility treatments impact the usage of both the hormonal test and the powder?",
            "row_content": "<p>In case of taking a contraceptive methods...<br/><br/>While you can certainly take both the hormonal test and use the powder for potential benefits, it's important to note that hormonal contraceptives, such as implants and pills, can affect hormone levels. <br/><br/>Since hormonal contraceptives regulate your hormone balance, the effects observed in the hormone test might not be as distinct as in individuals not using hormonal birth control. <br/>Moreover, when assessing the efficacy of the powder, its impact could be influenced by the contraceptive method you are utilising.<br/><br/>In case of a fertility treatment...<br/><br/>Fertility treatments often involve precise hormone manipulation that can influence hormonal test results. <br/><br/>It's vital to recognise that introducing new supplements, including the personalised powder, should be done under the guidance of your healthcare provider. <br/><br/>The introduction of external supplements could potentially disrupt the intended hormonal adjustments of the treatment, emphasising the importance of professional consultation.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--17607372964115__0a241f58-774b-4dc9-b402-ebb3e6193972-16739655325d1e4dcf-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "If I have endometriosis, will the powder work for me?",
            "row_content": "<p>Endometriosis is a medical condition that occurs when tissue resembling the uterine lining grows outside the womb, often in areas such as the ovaries or fallopian tubes. <br/>This condition can cause intense pain during a woman's menstrual cycle and, for some, even when they're not menstruating. <br/><br/>Diagnosis of endometriosis can be challenging, resulting in an average duration of 6-10 years before receiving an accurate diagnosis.<br/><br/>If you're diagnosed with endometriosis, then you're probably in more pain than our natural solutions can soothe all by themselves.<br/><br/>However,  the blend of ingredients aims to support overall hormone balance, potentially benefiting those with endometriosis. It's advisable to consult our experts to determine the best approach for your unique needs.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--17607372964115__0a241f58-774b-4dc9-b402-ebb3e6193972-16739655325d1e4dcf-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is the powder's blend compatible with any other supplements or vitamins that I might currently be taking?",
            "row_content": "<p>If you're currently using any medication or have been prescribed supplements for specific vitamin deficiencies, it's essential to consult your healthcare provider before incorporating Monthlies into your daily regimen.<br/><br/>Your personalised blend will be crafted to provide a fundamental level of hormone support, aiming to fulfil your body's requirements. <br/><br/>This implies that you might not need to acquire extra vitamin and mineral supplements to address foundational hormone balance needs.<br/><br/>Let's dive deeper into your situation with one of our experts during a personalised 1:1 consultation (included in the Monthlies Combo). During this session, we'll unveil your customised formula along with the precise dosage of its ingredients.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--17607372964115__0a241f58-774b-4dc9-b402-ebb3e6193972-16739655325d1e4dcf-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Could you provide more details about the composition of the powder? Is it suitable for vegans? How does it taste?",
            "row_content": "<p>The powder is carefully formulated with a curated selection of vitamins, minerals, extracts, and more, tailored to your hormone levels and cycle health objectives. <br/><br/>While the powder is currently suitable for vegetarians and 100% natural, it's important to note that it isn't suitable for vegans. <br/><br/>However, we are actively working towards making it suitable for vegans.In terms of flavour, we've dedicated careful attention to create a delightful orange taste, ensuring an enjoyable consumption experience. <br/><br/>If the taste poses a challenge, don't hesitate to reach out to us at info@withmonthlies.com. We're committed to finding a solution that suits your preferences!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "9d60fd2b-0408-4be6-8837-23a723f9e07d": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are there any extended benefits of Monthlies, such as improving skin issues?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes!, Monthlies is formulated to address hormonal imbalance, which can have positive effects on various aspects of health, including skin issues. <br/><br/>While the powder's primary focus is on hormone balance and menstrual symptoms, its comprehensive ingredients may contribute to overall well-being:</p><ul><li>Enhancing activity performance</li><li>Amplifying energy levels</li><li>Balancing your mood</li><li>Helping get a radiant skin and hair</li><li>And many more</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "d6395c54-3255-4e41-b45a-29f75568265e": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does it take to see results?",
            "row_content": "<p>The effects of using the powder can differ from person to person, but as a common trend, many customers start noticing positive changes within the first month. </p><p>The most significant improvements are often experienced after consistently using the product for about 90 days.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "bf845a6b-ed70-4981-b487-257c64793082": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's the recommended way to take the powder?",
            "row_content": "<p>Taking the powder is easy – simply consume 1 scoop a day, every day, consistency is key for optimal results!<br/><br/>It’s recommended to take it with food during the morning.<br/><br/>Simply mix itwith approximately 250 ml of water, juice, or your preferred beverage.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "2c361192-22dd-47ad-a812-62a01548ce09": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I discuss my hormone test results with an expert?",
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely!   <br/><br/>The Monthlies Combo includes a free 1:1 expert consultation, where you can discuss your results with one of our experts. <br/><br/>They will help you understand your hormone test results, answer any questions you may have, and provide recommendations and guidance on how to take control of your hormonal health for a pain-free and balanced life.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "208c5a73-ee97-4d80-9369-a861c1222982": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is the shipping process included?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the shipping process is hassle-free for you. <br/><br/>We offer a mailing bag with prepaid shipping for the hormone test, so all you need to do is send the prepared envelope containing your saliva sample back to our partner laboratory.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
